      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When you hire <strong>packers and movers from Kurnool to Bangalore</strong>, compliance with statutory transit paperwork is non‑negotiable.</p>
