<p>The next key document is the <em>IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty)</em>. Issued by the carrier, this receipt serves as the contract of carriage and proof of ownership of the goods while in transit. It lists item details, weight, value, and the agreed freight charges, and it is required for customs clearance and liability claims.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">To protect against unforeseen risks, a <strong>comprehensive 100 % declared‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance</strong> is recommended.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Even though the route is overland, the insurance covers accidental collision, theft, fire, and delays due to weather or road closures.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The policy is tailored to the declared value of the cargo, ensuring full reimbursement if any loss or damage occurs.</span></li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


