      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At the Bangalore distribution hub, the final delivery and uncrating protocol is designed to guarantee that every item arrives in pristine condition and is ready for immediate use. The process begins at daylight, allowing our team to verify the shipment against the original inventory bilty before any unboxing takes place.</p>

<p>Daylight Delivery Verification</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
