<p>Clean Furniture Placement</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>After testing, furniture pieces are carefully positioned on the showroom floor, following the layout plan provided by the client.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Each item is inspected for scratches or dents; any damage is documented and communicated to the client’s project manager.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>We use floor protection mats to prevent scuffs during placement and remove them once all items are in place.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>Swift Removal of Packing Debris</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>All packing materials—cardboard, bubble wrap, and packing peanuts—are collected in designated bins and transported to the waste disposal area.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Recyclable cardboard is sorted and sent to the local recycling facility; non‑recyclable waste is compacted for efficient transport.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The site is cleared within two hours of the final item being installed, ensuring a clean, ready‑for‑use environment for the client.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>By following this structured protocol, we guarantee a seamless transition from shipment to installation, maintaining the highest standards of quality and customer satisfaction at every step.</p></div>
